    "Id": "vehicledef_dragonlady",
    "Name": "Dragonlady Hovertank",
    "Details": "A Star League era combat support vehicle, the Dragonlady was a fast and versatile light scout tank created by Buhalin Military Products. Weighing in at 20 tons and with a top speed of 130kph; the Dragonlady was armed with a TAG and a NARC beacon in the vehicles turret. A single MPL provided the vehicles only offensive firepower. Produced in the thousands for the SLDF and then for the Great Houses, the Dragonlady was rendered extinct by the Succession Wars and few remain.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>        70     10\n<b>Left</b>          45     10\n<b>Right</b>        45     10\n<b>Rear</b>         35     10\n<b>Turret</b>       45     10\n\n<b>Total</b>      240     50</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Communications</color>",
